    "head_branch": "feature/spec-38-1a-groups-bounded",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(groups): forming up reads its columns once a pass and finds pairs through a grid (spec 38 step 1a)\n\nFormationGroups._form_up read the whole battle's RANK column twice and\nits POSITION column once for every pair of groups at ease (Decision 150).\nIt now reads both once a pass per store, works out each group's back row\nonce, and looks only at pairs GroupPairs finds through a grid of the\ngroups' positions, in the list order trying every pair gave. Outcomes\nunchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SXFihqduYAkztdcN8UbTvP",
